# GitOps Scripts

## Render → push → reconcile

```bash
./scripts/render_flannel_gitops.sh
./scripts/render_multus_gitops.sh          # before OAI NADs
./scripts/render_oai_operators_gitops.sh central
./scripts/render_oai_core_gitops.sh central
./scripts/render_oai_ran_gitops.sh regional
./scripts/render_oai_ran_du_gitops.sh edge
./scripts/render_metallb_gitops.sh mgmt central regional edge
./scripts/render_dashboard_gitops.sh mgmt central regional edge
./bringup/03_push_to_git_repos/push_git_repos.sh
./scripts/check-configsync.sh
```

## Config Sync bringup

```bash
./bringup/01_gitea/gitea.sh
./bringup/02_configsync/configsync.sh      # repos → tokens → install
```

## Output paths

Rendered manifests go under `repos/{cluster}-repo/` (or `repos/mgmt/`). Do not hand-edit generated files without updating the corresponding `render_*` script.

## Cluster args

Most render scripts accept cluster names: `mgmt central regional edge`. OAI render scripts are cluster-specific (central-only for core/operators).
